      <div class="mission-category">Event · Barcelona</div>
      <h1>Marine Technology &amp; Innovation Forum 2026</h1>
      <p class="mission-lead">An evening at IAAC where students, researchers, partners and industry shared their work on marine technology and robotics.</p>
      <dl class="mission-facts">
        <div><dt>Date</dt><dd>21 May 2026, 18:30</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Venue</dt><dd>IAAC Main Hall, Barcelona</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Hosted by</dt><dd>NODE Engineering Club</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <figure class="mission-cover">
        <img src="/images/missions/forum/marine-tech-forum-2026.jpg" alt="Poster for the Marine Technology and Innovation Forum 2026, 21 May, 18:30 at IAAC Main Hall, with partner logos">
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mission-section">
    <div class="mission-section-inner">
      <div class="section-label">The forum</div>
      <p class="mission-text">NODE brought together students, researchers, collaborators and industry professionals at the Institute for Advanced Architecture of Catalonia to share ongoing work, discuss emerging technologies and look for new ways to collaborate across marine technology and robotics.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

