      <ol class="mission-plan">
        <li><span>Host</span><strong>IAAC</strong><p>For hosting the forum in its Main Hall.</p></li>
        <li><span>Talk</span><strong>Open Cosmos</strong><p>For their presentation and continued support.</p></li>
        <li><span>New partner</span><strong>Cerulean Sonar</strong><p>Welcomed as a new partner of NODE.</p></li>
        <li><span>Partners</span><strong>Kelp Blue and LaMáquina</strong><p>For supporting our projects and helping develop our hull.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mission-section">
    <div class="mission-section-inner">
      <div class="section-label">What came next</div>
      <p class="mission-text">The forum set the stage for <a href="/missions/njord-2026">Njord 2026</a> in Trondheim and for our first field mission, <a href="/missions/namibia-2026">Namibia 2026</a>. The next NODE event is planned for 2027.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

